# Agent runtime env template.
#
# The platform materializes each Agent home at:
#   FLEETENT_HOME/agents/<agent-id>/
#
# That materialize step writes the Agent's `.env` from the current `agent.yaml`
# references (`models.targets[*].api_key_env`, `mcp_servers[*].api_key_env`,
# connector `*_env`, and knowledge connector `*_env`) and preserves operator-filled
# values. Do not maintain a static inventory of model, Slack, MCP, or Knowledge Base
# secret names here.
